  "content": "\n\n<center>\n  <h1>飾紋 - 色彩潑濺！🎨</h1>\nAdds <b>29 種飾紋材料</b>，您可以在鍛造台上將其套用至盔甲！<br>\nHeavily inspired by <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/more-trim-colors\">More Trim Colors</a> by <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Skottify\">Skottify</a>！<br><br>\n  <!--\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/trims-color-splash\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/trims-color-splash?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=Modrinth&color=00af5c\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Keito0-0/Trims-ColorSplash?color=orange&logo=github\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1432131877875093537?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&logo=Discord&\">\n  </a>\n  -->\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cd22dc1f56be69b18ff627469b68ba696753c2e7.png\"></img>\n</center>\n\n<br><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/K6FfrDg63Q\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/99d8e1537bdc422307a8e4c702cd2dec0b31c64a.png\" width=\"400\"></a> <br><i>如果您有任何問題，歡迎加入 Discord 伺服器！</i></p>\n<br><br>\n<hr>\n<p align=\"center\"><em>（使用數據包版本時，請務必安裝所需的資源包，否則將無法正常運作！）</em><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c600dcd0fa9a3d3162106e4b6aff4e925069472c_0.webp\" alt=\"資源包下載指南\"></p>\n<details>\n  <summary>所有新增飾紋材料</summary>\n  <h2> 1.21.4 及以上版本 </h2>\n<!-- =============== TABLE ============= -->\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f724bc9407914c20aef04c1deaa5247ca14c40ed.png\" alt=\"犰狳鱗片\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>犰狳鱗片</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e27954e374e57db722946ae8fdd4c99f5a7f0fe0.png\" alt=\"烈焰棒\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>烈焰棒</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d88f8a4fe8030e4cadc8