.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5d0726a93acd84c43a28d225d2b40b952a6a30c1.png\" alt=\"海洋之心\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>海洋之心</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9c847f288c3ca832fd5c662cdbb421700f3c9b1e.png\" alt=\"皮革\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>皮革</strong> </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7b4787c7aed1d738aa070f48339738dc001ca487.png\" alt=\"熔岩膏\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>熔岩膏</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6ca74675dd8c9e8d33ea94baceda100764039aa9.png\" alt=\"鸚鵡螺殼\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>鸚鵡螺殼</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f770a646e3d5aa721420a06195768c3b30d0faad.png\" alt=\"下界之星\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>下界之星</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f894f116d4486cc7f0a8f4174255e5967d31c8c3.png\" alt=\"地獄疣\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>地獄疣</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7ac5483efbd15a265bfd61c28d1b29ce5b4f202d.png\" alt=\"獄髓碎塊\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>獄髓碎塊</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d87480d5ed773de1b05c2ca05293e46575910d0.png\" alt=\"黑曜石\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>黑曜石</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7d9916159d3f54ea2c428e9f92c7f807ade1d00.png\" alt=\"幻翼膜\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>幻翼膜</strong> </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/725824f3a3e467be1c7c621c72ae16719c9cf801.png\" alt=\"棱鏡石碎片\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>棱鏡石碎片</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/468bdd915fda7881cf2365d767f3829e7c606c90.png\" alt=\"棱鏡石結晶\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>棱鏡石結晶</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0cd8c9134829b9c9014bf41dd5eebf9d65315418.png\" alt=\"兔皮\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>兔皮</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc4c7dd12c04da913c1776ae37b7631cbc614b93.png\" alt=\"玫瑰金\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>玫瑰金</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/69e0a8f4af7c45929792bb81bbfe6a281526d08b.png\" alt=\"潛影貝殼\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>潛影貝殼</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3aed45464d92e8d667f3b963de2206df50de4dae.png\" alt=\"黏液球\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>黏液球</strong> </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/51c8bbcdfda444c9ba214df675fc4630d494f708.png\" alt=\"龜鱗片\" width=\"35px\"> <br> <strong>龜鱗片</strong> </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>視覺上移除飾紋</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c57de99c7649413d119e55b3e8eae4e68de77422.png\" alt=\"玻璃\" width=\"16px\"> 玻璃</li>\n  </ul>\n  <h2>較舊版本</h2>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f724bc9407914c20aef04c1deaa5247ca14c40ed.png\" alt=\"犰狳鱗片\"> 犰狳鱗片 -> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c4837669d61294e19fe120bc92922ded6137bed4.png\" alt=\"磚塊\"> <b>磚塊</b> (< 1.20.5)</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc4c7dd12c04da913c1776ae37b7631cbc614b93.png\" alt=\"玫瑰金\"> 玫瑰金 -> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4a3ffa2bb686c43173efb0f2f48b549dc85ee98.png\" alt=\"蜂蜜塊\"> <b>蜂蜜塊</b> (< 1.21)</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f3dcd13d1c4cfc5fa60c6d176204b24a9199d1e.png\" alt=\"樹脂磚\"> 樹脂磚 -> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c158431146787c8b98b954118eddac30ab3da10.png\" alt=\"熔岩塊\"> <b>熔岩塊</b> (< 1.21.4)</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f1f604e98c11b1b956ac5c3d00510afaf76b9307.png\" alt=\"旋風棒\"> 旋風棒 -> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/75bc6180d3da535b734cb0edf190f4bbfde81285.png\" alt=\"珠光蛙燈\"> <b>珠光蛙燈</b> (< 1.21)</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>玫瑰金合成配方</summary>\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47b3305b3b396c489b89feddeeb18ca811c943f6.jpeg\" alt=\"玫瑰金配方\"></p>\n  <p>（無特定排列）</p>\n</details>\n<hr>\n<h2>✅ 此數據包相容於：</h2>\n<details>\n  <summary>相容模組</summary><br>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/elytra-trims\">Elytra Trims</a><i> (KikuGie)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/elytra-trims\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/352a7a2a433fd95cb619e8066d0c93ac98f192f6.png\" alt=\"Elytra Trims Logo\"></a> - （無物品材質）<br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tool-trims-mod\">Tool Trims Mod</a><i> (ThePotatoArchivist)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tool-trims-mod\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3685121bd145cc5579a8cc32df7b816402b9c32.png\" alt=\"Tool Trims Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/alexs-caves\">Alex's Caves</a><i> (AlexModGuy)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/alexs-caves\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7423f750e5d7f8d58c0574834e5f6d9f18da1373.jpeg\" alt=\"Alex's Caves Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ancient-aether\">Ancient Aether</a><i> (Builderdog841)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ancient-aether\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/26e3bd5071cba4f02728285cc20db492baf1f3cb_0.webp\" alt=\"Ancient Aether Logo\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/frostiful\">Frostiful</a><i> (TheDeathlyCow)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/frostiful\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c820ca41867564677535e9dab9afcc81002005e1.jpeg\" alt=\"Frostiful Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/geode-plus\">Geode+</a><i> (Team Chorus)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/geode-plus\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/392b223d19aaa24958964dbaa746157a1be6094d_0.webp\" alt=\"Geode+ Logo\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-armor-trims\">More Armor Trims</a><i> (masik16u)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-armor-trims\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f2a23aa9fedc6117c5ba45bd64d6b00e1bb7e63e.jpeg\" alt=\"More Armor Trims Logo\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-sniffer-flowers?version=1.20.1&loader=forge\">More Sniffer Flowers</a><i> (Nikdo53)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-sniffer-flowers?version=1.20.1&loader=forge\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1969e48ebed72cda4ac20259b7d94cac437517a2.jpeg\" alt=\"More Sniffer Flowers Logo\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/tates-extra-trims\">TaTe's Extra Trims</a><i> (AverageTaTeMan)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/tates-extra-trims\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a4635f6e8b82972d03b892d14cf498a5c7392e58.png\" alt=\"TaTe's Extra Trims Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n     <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/too-many-trims\">Too Many Trims</a><i> (Herobrine011840)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/too-many-trims\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2450ea3cd876ffbe42d91d2e616bf69e68804116.gif\" alt=\"Too Many Trims Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/trims-expanded\">Trims Expanded</a><i> (Omniv)</i><br>\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/trims-expanded\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0df45c329af4b9b0d4eef509083388bac0b5bc9f.jpeg\" alt=\"Trims Expanded Logo\" width=\"96px\"></a><br><br>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</details>\n\n## ❓ 常見問題：\n### Q：嘗試為盔甲添加飾紋時，鍛造台配方上顯示紅色「X」？<br>\n**A**：請先將飾紋材料丟到地上，再次撿起後嘗試合成。若問題仍存在，請重啟伺服器。若上述步驟均無法解決，請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/K6FfrDg63Q\">Discord 伺服器</a> 或 GitHub 頁面上回報問題。\n\n### Q：為什麼我無法將材料放置在鍛造台上？<br>\n**A**：若嘗試上述修復後問題依舊，請再次確認您已正確安裝數據包。若您確定安裝無誤，請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/K6FfrDg63Q\">Discord 伺服器</a> 或 GitHub 頁面上回報問題。\n\n### Q：為什麼所有配方都無法運作？<br>\n**A**：您可能需要重新載入世界、重啟伺服器或 Realms。重新載入後配方應可正常運作。\n\n### Q：使用時出現缺失材質的提示，該如何解決？<br>\n**A**：使用數據包版本時，必須下載並安裝所需的資源包。\n\n### Q：在哪裡可以找到並下載資源包？<br>\nA：Modrinth 上的主要下載按鈕僅提供數據包，不含資源包。您需要前往「Versions（版本）」標籤頁查找並下載資源包檔案。（請參閱頁面頂部的圖片）\n\n<details>\n  <summary>致謝：</summary>\n  - 特別感謝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Skottify\">Skottify </a>提供的靈感！<br><br>\n  - 特別感謝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/lynx-xdg\">Lynx </a>協助生成檔案！<br><br>\n  - 感謝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Lightningfoxxy\">Lightningfoxxy </a>協助轉換函數！<br><br>\n  - 並感謝所有本地化貢獻者！♥ <i>（詳見 v1.3.0 更新日誌）</i>\n</details>",
